# Data directories
# Ignore everything in data/ EXCEPT data/processed/harmonized_soil_moisture_data and data/processed/harmonization
data/*

# But don't ignore data/processed (its contents are ignored below, except the folders listed): a file can only be
# re-included when its parent directory is not ignored
!data/processed/
data/processed/*
!data/processed/harmonized_soil_moisture_data/
!data/processed/harmonized_soil_moisture_data/**
!data/processed/README.md
# generic harmonization outputs (python -m essdive_harmonize.harmonize.run --write)
!data/processed/harmonization/
!data/processed/harmonization/**

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
